      "n": "#392·31",
      "text": "This is a floor-length dress in deep brown satin, featuring a dramatic wide capelet that drapes over the shoulders and a sleek silhouette that flows gracefully from waist to hem."
    },
    {
      "n": "#26·17",
      "text": "These are tall boots made of soft burgundy suede with a distinct slouchy texture, set on a sturdy black block heel for stability and height."
    },
    {
      "n": "#79·20",
      "text": "This is a structured handbag in glossy red leather with a subtle crocodile embossing pattern, featuring a top handle and a decorative metallic clasp on the front."
    },
    {
      "n": "#283·38",
      "text": "This is an oversized khaki puffer coat with horizontal quilting, a high collar that can be worn up for warmth, and large pockets at the hip level."
